The pre-commit hook's SOURCE/OWNED/SURFACES formula and sync-plugin-versions.sh's SOURCE/CODEX_MANIFEST/OPENCODE_PACKAGE/ANTIGRAVITY_MANIFEST formula both derive each full plugin's four platform-manifest paths from the same plugins-<platform>/<name>/... convention; the hook's version_only_change diffing and git-add calls, and the sync script's propagation, both depend on these staying byte-identical, so a convention change in one without the other silently targets the wrong (or a nonexistent) file.
